fixtures/REGISTRY.md
    Records the provenance of the two-language parity fixtures under
    fixtures/. The Buzz Evidence Contract profiles the fixtures exercise
    (nostr-pubkey host-principal profile; buzz.agent-job/v1,
    buzz.moderation/v1, buzz.release/v1) belong to the capsule-registry
    and agent-action-capsule repositories, NOT here — this repository only
    consumes those profile names.

"Buzz" is used here only as a public project name; see README.md's boundary
statement and the fail-closed neutrality gate in
.github/workflows/neutrality.yml.
